<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh's forex market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh's forex market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange market was closed on Thursday for the Moslem Eid al-Fitr holiday.</p>
<p>The market will reopen for a short period on Saturday and then will remain shut until February 12.</p>
<p>The taka closed at 42.4900/42.5100 to the dollar in interbank trading on Wednesday against the previous 42.5150/5300.</p>
<p>-- Dhaka Newsroom +880-2-506363</p>
</text>
